---
source: crates/nash-ast/src/head.rs
description: "Impls in declaration order and how each one matches the arguments. Inference uses SelectPolicy::Defer; entailment and evidence use SelectPolicy::Exact."
---
no impls
  inference: no impl
  closed types: no impl
does not match, does not match
  inference: no impl
  closed types: no impl
does not match, matches, does not match
  inference: selects impl 2
  closed types: selects impl 2
matches, undecided
  inference: waits
  closed types: selects impl 1
undecided, matches
  inference: waits
  closed types: selects impl 2
undecided, does not match
  inference: waits
  closed types: no impl
does not match, matches (budget for one step)
  inference: work limit
  closed types: work limit
